From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Subject: po: the Screensavers link of Wallpaper in the edition's nine other languages

The edition's translations of the strings plasma-workspace-screensavers-link.patch adds
(queue row 96), on the 6.7.4 catalogues as the edition has patched them so far.
A first draft made with AI assistance, pending native speakers; KDE's
translation teams take the strings later.

Assisted-by: Claude Fable 5.2
---
diff --git a/po/pl/kcm_wallpaper.po b/po/pl/kcm_wallpaper.po
--- a/po/pl/kcm_wallpaper.po
+++ b/po/pl/kcm_wallpaper.po
@@ -67,3 +67,9 @@
 msgctxt "@info"
 msgid "Videos with pop effects are not expected to be comfortable with widgets or other things over it."
 msgstr "Filmy z efektami wysunięcia nie będą wygodne w odbiorze, gdy nad nimi są elementy interfejsu lub inne rzeczy."
+
+#: kcms/wallpaper/ui/main.qml
+#, kde-format
+msgctxt "@action:button opens the Screensavers settings page"
+msgid "Screensavers…"
+msgstr "Wygaszacze ekranu…"
